<title>USA: TABLE - Aquila Biopharma Q2 net loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Aquila Biopharma Q2 net loss.</headline>
<dateline>WORCESTER, Mass. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data, unaudited)</p>
<p>				 Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
